  "description": "Reborn in South Korea in 2026, former hero Yong Sajun struggles to adjust to a world without magic or dragons. After surviving a brutal job market, he finally lands a position at a major corporation - only to come face to face with the man he once loved in his past life: the prince he failed to save. Haunted by memories of tragedy, Sajun tries to keep his distance. But when he discovers that the prince has been cursed, Sajun resolves to save him once again…even if it means juggling deadlines and danger alike!\n\n_Source: Lezhin US_\n\n## Notes\n- All official translations are uncensored, except for Japanese.\n- This series is a global release, meaning all official translations come out on the same day as the original Korean.",
